Candidate automated GUI tests for the Fearless manager (M) and the eclipse plugin (E).
One line each: class name - what it checks. Status marks: DONE <round>, INFEASIBLE <reason>.
Manager data folder = fearless0_001 beside the app; it holds projects.info, activity.txt, messages/, eclipse/ (state.info, console.txt, <alias>/console.txt).
Manager tests extend Controllers/test/agentTools/ManagerTest (launcher, launch(args...), look(), same(a,b), clean() also run after each test).
Eclipse is unpacked at /data/fearlessBranch3/eclipse (not in /opt); plugin tests wait until the manager tests are well covered.

